OL,3,GNEWSACounty and city boundary shake-up
OL,4,Aplans put on hold
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a major shake-up of
OL,7,Fboundaries in Nottingham and
OL,8,FNottinghamshire are on hold.
OL,10,FParts of the surrounding boroughs of
OL,11,FBroxtowe, Gedling, and Rushcliffe were
OL,12,Fset to be merged with the city, with a
OL,13,Fnew "Greater Nottingham Council"
OL,14,Fcreated to manage all the area's
OL,15,Fservices.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
