OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSACounty and city boundary shake-up
OL,4,Aplans put on hold
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second unitary authority, called
OL,7,F"Nottinghamshire Council", was also set
OL,8,Fto be established, comprising the
OL,9,Fdistricts of Ashfield, Mansfield,
OL,10,FBassetlaw, and Newark and Sherwood
OL,11,Falong with the remaining parts of the
OL,12,Fabove three boroughs.
OL,14,FPlans were put on hold last month and
OL,15,Fon Thursday, the government confirmed
OL,16,FNottingham and Nottinghamshire were
OL,17,Famong nine areas where plans had been
OL,18,Fwithdrawn and would be reconsidered.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
